  "id": "spicy-lime-avocado-soup",
  "name": "Spicy Lime Avocado Soup",
  "subtitle": "Creamy avocado soup with poached chicken, jalapeño, and fresh lime",
  "description": "A smooth, savory soup combining tender chicken, creamy avocado, bright lime, and fresh chile heat.",
